Lance Corporal Schofield, played by George MacKay.

5
00:27:02,727 --> 00:27:08,727
Lance Corporal Blake, played by Dean-Charles Chapman.

6
00:32:27,272 --> 00:32:33,272
Captain Smith, played by Mark Strong.

7
